2 CONT Brief Life History of Paul
2 CONT
2 CONT When Paul Njaa was born on 4 April 1896, in Ball Hill Township, Griggs, North Dakota, United States, his father, Arnt Arntsen Njaa, was 30 and his mother, Karen Herigstad, was 31. He married Anne Person on 9 June 1929, in Griggs, 
2 CONC North Dakota, United States. They were the parents of at least 1 son. He lived in Ball Hill, Warwickshire, England, United Kingdom in 1900 and Griggs, North Dakota, United States in 1910. He died on 24 September 1956, in Spokane, 
2 CONC Spokane, Washington, United States, at the age of 60.       By Lars G.
